IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PB1294N3.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
FILE-CONTROL.
    SELECT PRT ASSIGN TO "PB1294N3.TXT".
DATA DIVISION.
FILE SECTION.
FD  PRT REPORT IS R.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01  WS-A PIC 99 VALUE 0.
01  WS-B PIC 99 VALUE 0.
REPORT SECTION.
RD  R CONTROL IS FINAL.
01  DET TYPE DE LINE PLUS 1.
    05  CELL COLUMN 1 PIC 99 OCCURS 2 TIMES STEP 3 SOURCE WS-A WS-B.
01  CFF TYPE CF FINAL LINE PLUS 1.
    05  TOT COLUMN 1 PIC 999 SUM CELL(2).
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-PARA.
    STOP RUN.
